=
=       ```scala
-       import soundness.*
+       import soundness.*

-       case class Reading(celsius: Double)
+       case class Reading(celsius: Double)

-       given Reading is Continuous = _.celsius
+       given Reading is Continuous = _.celsius

=       given Reading is Continuous = _.celsius
-       ```
+       ```

