-   entry .Fit   a line chart's fit: the `#abscissa` and `#ordinate` scales
-     entry #abscissa   the abscissa `Scale`, over the extent of the positions
-     entry #ordinate   the ordinate `Scale`, over the extent of the positions and their intervals
